00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:40,520
The invention of gunpowder was the single most important advance in the annals of warfare.

48
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:42,900
It began in ancient China.

49
00:04:42,901 --> 00:04:50,460
the rocket was probably one of the very first applications of the after the invention of black

