The Europeans rapidly developed large guns to propel high explosives as far as possible.

58
00:05:37,601 --> 00:05:44,600
The Industrial Revolution made possible great advances in the manufacture of refined steels,

59
00:05:44,601 --> 00:05:49,600
that size volume for volume were much stronger and much lighter than the old wrought iron

60
00:05:49,601 --> 00:05:52,600
and other materials that had been used before.

61
00:05:52,601 --> 00:05:57,600
So that guns became stronger, but at the same time, weight from size for size became lighter.

62
00:05:57,601 --> 00:06:02,600
So you could build much larger and larger guns that could withstand greater internal pressure.

