93
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:55,420
I think it was about 156 calibers long, whereas most guns at the time were 30 or 40 calibers was long.

94
00:07:55,421 --> 00:08:00,560
and from a range of 72 miles and hidden away in a forest,

