00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:02,940
it could literally rain shells on Paris.

96
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:03,920
That was the idea.

97
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:08,180
As artillery became larger and less mobile,

98
00:08:08,300 --> 00:08:11,600
it was also more vulnerable to a new use of high explosives,

99
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:14,180
the delivery of bombs from the air.

100
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:23,500
World War I, we used a lot of bombs delivered by aircraft.

