198
00:15:19,460 --> 00:15:24,180
So they were free in clandestine conditions to develop a whole new family of artillery.

199
00:15:25,020 --> 00:15:29,160
And by 1939, they were well on their way to producing those guns in great numbers,

200
00:15:29,580 --> 00:15:33,100
which is what modern war requires, not just modern guns, but large numbers as well.

201
00:15:33,560 --> 00:15:37,460
And the Allies had a heck of a job to actually try and catch up with them.

202
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:48,520
