00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:16,740
We could sometimes put 8, 10, 20, 30 battalions on some of the critical targets.

208
00:16:16,741 --> 00:16:18,880
this is something that most of the other

209
00:16:18,881 --> 00:16:20,140
artillery couldn't do

